<div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-inverse-deep px-5 py-9 md:px-30 md:py-15"><span class="mark pointer-events-none absolute -left-24 -top-16 h-[520px] w-[450px] text-accent opacity-[0.06] md:-left-45 md:-top-30 md:h-[760px] md:w-[658px] inline-block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="86.6" height="100" viewBox="0 0 86.6 100"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M43.3 0L86.6 25V75L43.3 100L0 75V25L43.3 0ZM43.3 20C48 35.06 63.46 44.02 63.46 56.9C63.46 68.03 54.43 77.06 43.3 77.06C32.17 77.06 23.14 68.03 23.14 56.9C23.14 44.02 38.6 35.06 43.3 20Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
</span><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:gap-9"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4 md:w-[656px] md:gap-[18px]"><p class="text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em] text-accent">LICENSED #PL-40219   ·   $2M INSURED   ·   4,100 JOBS SINCE 2011</p><h1 class="font-display font-bold text-[30px] md:text-[46px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-inverse">Your plumbing fixed today — at a price we agree before we start.</h1><p class="hidden md:block text-[17px] leading-[1.58] text-on-inverse-muted">Written flat rate on your doorstep. 2-hour arrival window. 12-month warranty. Late and the call-out is free.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-[14px] md:text-[16px]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="font-semibold text-success">✓</span><span class="font-medium text-on-inverse">Flat rate in writing — the number never moves</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="font-semibold text-success">✓</span><span class="font-medium text-on-inverse">2-hour arrival window, or the call-out is free</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="font-semibold text-success">✓</span><span class="font-medium text-on-inverse">12-month workmanship warranty, parts included</span></div></div><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5"><a href="#quote" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] px-[22px] py-[14px] md:px-8 md:py-[19px] font-display font-semibold text-[15px] md:text-[18px] transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 bg-action text-on-action ">Get my flat price  →</a><a href="tel:+15035550148" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] px-[22px] py-[14px] md:px-8 md:py-[19px] font-display font-semibold text-[15px] md:text-[18px] transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 border-[1.5px] border-rule-inverse text-on-inverse ">(503) 555-0148</a></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[13px] md:text-[14px] text-on-inverse"><span class="flex items-center gap-[7px] whitespace-nowrap"><span class="font-semibold">★★★★★  4.9</span><span class="text-on-inverse-muted">612 Google reviews</span></span><span class="text-rule-inverse">|</span><span class="flex items-center gap-[7px] whitespace-nowrap"><span class="font-semibold">43 min</span><span class="text-on-inverse-muted">average arrival</span></span><span class="text-rule-inverse">|</span><span class="flex items-center gap-[7px] whitespace-nowrap"><span class="font-semibold">96%</span><span class="text-on-inverse-muted">fixed same day</span></span></div></div><form id="quote" method="post" action="/quote" class="flex w-full flex-col gap-5 rounded-[18px] bg-surface px-6 py-7 shadow-[0_20px_48px_0_rgba(0,13,31,0.34)] md:w-[480px] md:px-[34px] md:pb-[30px] md:pt-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-[7px]"><p class="font-display text-[24px] font-bold text-ink md:text-[30px]">Get your flat price</p><p class="text-[15px] text-ink-soft">90 seconds. No obligation, no call-out fee.</p></div><label class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-mid">WHAT&#39;S WRONG?</span><select class="w-full rounded-[9px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent" name="job" required=true><option value="blocked_drain">Blocked drain</option><option value="burst_pipe">Burst or leaking pipe</option><option value="hot_water">Hot water</option><option value="tap_toilet">Tap, toilet or cistern</option><option value="sewer_line">Sewer line</option><option value="leak_detection">Leak detection</option><option value="repipe">Whole-house repipe</option><option value="fit_out">Bathroom or kitchen fit-out</option><option value="other">Something else</option></select></label><label class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-mid">WHERE ARE YOU?</span><input class="w-full rounded-[9px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent" type="text" name="zip" placeholder="Suburb or ZIP code" required=true/></label><label class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-mid">MOBILE</span><input class="w-full rounded-[9px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-4 py-[15px] text-[16px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent" type="tel" name="mobile" placeholder="(503) 000-0000" required=true/></label><button type="submit" class="w-full rounded-[10px] bg-action py-[19px] font-display text-[18px] font-semibold text-on-action">Send me my price  →</button><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.52] text-ink-soft">We text your price band back within 10 minutes, 7am–9pm. Emergency right now? Call (503) 555-0148 — we pick up 24/7.</p><div class="h-px w-full bg-rule"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="font-semibold text-success">✓</span><span class="text-[13px] font-medium text-ink-mid">Your number is used to send the quote. Nothing else, ever.</span></div></form></div></div>
